{"id": "t004-005", "text": "dinner @ Mustafa + Farah's Fri at 8. their kids in bed by then so no need to bring anything for them", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri at 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by then", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t004-007", "text": "Oisín's mum 70th Oct 29, big do at the GAA club in Ennis. he's organising the whole thing - caterers, band, slideshow - and his sisters aren't helping much. stressed + not sleeping. said the hall's only booked til 11 and the DJ cancelled on him Tues. I'm going over Oct 28, flying Thurs at 4pm. check in w/ him next wk, maybe offer to do the slideshow", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 29", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big do at the GAA club in Ennis", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sisters", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "til 11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "DJ", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 28", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs at 4pm", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "next wk", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to do the slideshow", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t004-011", "text": "Carlos called - dinner Thurs is off, his dad's not well. reschedule. should check in on him over wkd", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "not well", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "reschedule", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over wkd", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t004-014", "text": "Valentina leaving drinks @ the Crown, 5/22 from 6pm. moving back to Madrid for good. must get card + chip in for present", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks @ the Crown", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/22 from 6pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Madrid", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in for present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t004-016", "text": "Sofia viewing a flat in Bristol Saturday at 2 - 1 bed in Bedminster, £1150/m, way over budget. her sister Ann going with her. Sofia nervous about it, has been looking since March and keeps getting outbid. also viewing one in Easton Sunday morning at 10. she's started at the new job there already so commuting from Bath every day, 2hrs round trip. ask Mon how they went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing a flat in Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since March"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing one in Easton", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning at 10", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "commuting from Bath every day, 2hrs round trip", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Mon how they went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t004-024", "text": "Gabriel's 30th - surprise party, his partner Jo organising. Sat 7/12 at 8pm, Jo's flat in Brixton. keep schtum, Gabriel thinks we're just doing dinner. Jo asked everyone to arrive by half 7 + hide in the kitchen. theme is 70s. need to get him something - he collects vinyl, mostly Bowie + Talking Heads, Jo says he doesn't have Low on original pressing. budget ~£40. also tell Elijah the time changed", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gabriel", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat 7/12 at 8pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat in Brixton", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gabriel", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by half 7", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Bowie", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Talking Heads", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't have Low on original pressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell Elijah the time changed", "owner": "p7", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t004-027", "text": "Dimitri - just back from moving his parents to Cyprus. exhausted. their dog Pushkin went too. ask how they're settling", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dimitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pushkin", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how they're settling", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t004-031", "text": "Sean + Mila engaged!! he proposed on the beach in Cornwall last wkd, she said yes before he finished the question lol. engagement party at theirs next Sat 8pm, bring fizz. she wants a summer wedding, July maybe, somewhere in Lisbon cos her gran's from there. Sean's already stressing re budget. Mila's sister Valentina doing the planning apparently", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engaged", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last wkd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sat 8pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring fizz", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "summer wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "July", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
