{"id": "t004-039", "text": "Anil - into 3D printing, makes Warhammer minis. painted a whole Space Marines army, took him like 2 yrs. showed me pics, actually incredible. entering some of them into a painting comp in Nottingham Nov 9. wants an airbrush, the Iwata one, could go in on one w/ Carlos for his bday Dec 12th?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "3D printing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Warhammer minis", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "painted a whole Space Marines army", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "painting comp in Nottingham", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants an airbrush, the Iwata one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go in on one w/ Carlos", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 12th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
