{"id": "t004-053", "text": "Andile - interview Monday at 10 for job in Cape Town, head of design at a fintech. would mean moving home after 8 yrs here. v torn about it, his partner Lwazi doesn't want to go, their daughter just started school. second round would be Thurs afternoon if he gets through. he's nervous, hasn't interviewed in ages. text him Sun night + ask Weds how it went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "torn", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't want to go", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs afternoon", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sun night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Weds how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weds", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t004-054", "text": "Alina - new place in Peckham, moving 4/20. her old landlord keeping deposit, she's fuming. remind me to send her that tenancy rights link", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "place in Peckham", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4/20", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "keeping deposit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fuming", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that tenancy rights link", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t004-056", "text": "Gintaras - Lithuanian basketball obsessive, Žalgiris since he was a kid. trip to Kaunas for a game Feb 8 w/ his brother Tomas, tickets already sorted. also mentioned his knee is playing up again, physio Weds at 4:15 + scan the wk after. he's worried it'll stop him playing Sunday league. remind me to send him that physio's number", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Lithuanian basketball", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Žalgiris", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since he was a kid"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Kaunas for a game", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Feb 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomas", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee is playing up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weds at 4:15", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Sunday league", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that physio's number", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "physio"}]}
